{
  "name": "passport-demo",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "prepare:zk": "node scripts/prepare-zk-assets.mjs",
    "check:pwa": "node scripts/check-pwa.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test e2e/onboarding.spec.ts",
    "test:e2e:live": "RUN_LIVE=1 LIVE_URL=https://staging.midnightpassport.com playwright test e2e/stagenet.live.spec.ts",
    "test:e2e:live:prod": "RUN_LIVE=1 LIVE_URL=https://midnightpassport.com playwright test e2e/stagenet.live.spec.ts",
    "test:pwa": "npm run build && npm run check:pwa",
    "dev": "npm run prepare:zk && vite",
    "preview": "vite preview --host localhost",
    "build": "npm run prepare:zk && tsc --noEmit && vite build"
  },
  "//test:e2e:live": [
    "THE LIVE WALK POINTS AT STAGING BY DEFAULT (2026/09/15). It used to run",
    "against https://midnightpassport.com — the spec's own LIVE_URL default —",
    "which put the one command anybody types to check a build on the link",
    "stakeholders hold, and left a real account contract and a claimed .night",
    "name on it each time. The delivery rule is that a build is walked on",
    "staging and only promoted afterwards, so the default is the environment",
    "the rule names.",
    "",
    "`test:e2e:live:prod` is the same walk against production, for confirming a",
    "promotion after the fact. Both set LIVE_URL explicitly rather than relying",
    "on the spec's default, so which site is being walked is visible in the",
    "command."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "@dynamic-labs/ethereum": "5.8.0",
    "@dynamic-labs/sdk-react-core": "5.8.0",
    "@fontsource/outfit": "^5.3.0",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/compact-js": "2.5.5-rc.8",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/compact-runtime": "0.19.0-rc.0",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-contracts": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-fetch-zk-config-provider": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-http-client-proof-provider": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-indexer-public-data-provider": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-network-id": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-types": "5.0.0-beta.7",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/wallet-sdk": "2.0.0-beta.2",
    "@midnight-ntwrk/zkir-v2": "2.1.0",
    "@midnightntwrk/ledger-v9": "1.0.0-rc.3",
    "@noble/curves": "2.4.0",
    "bip39": "^3.1.0",
    "bot-avatars": "0.1.1",
    "buffer": "^6.0.3",
    "jsqr": "^1.4.0",
    "lucide-react": "^0.468.0",
    "motion": "^13.0.0",
    "passport-demo-backend": "file:../../demo-backend",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "rxjs": "^7.8.2",
    "uqr": "^0.1.3",
    "ws": "^8.19.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@playwright/test": "^1.62.1",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.12",
    "@types/react-dom": "^18.3.1",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^4.3.4",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^3.2.7",
    "vite": "^6.0.0",
    "vite-plugin-wasm": "^3.3.0"
  }
}
